reconfigure.description:
Sign in with another Salto KS account for {title}. You will be sent to the Salto KS login page, which asks for the username and password of the account to use.

After switching:
- sites and locks the new account can access keep working as before;
- sites and locks it cannot access become unavailable (you can remove those devices);
- sites and locks that only the new account can access are added;
- the device of the previous account becomes unavailable and a new account device is created.

Locking, unlocking and Easy Office Mode changes depend on the permissions of the new account.
